  "body": "no, different one. #70064 is about `styles` rewrite and needs `provideCssVarNamespacing()`. Here nothing opts in: `[style.--x]` gets key `--%NS%x` while static `style` and `[style]` stay `--x`, so host binding overwrites author value and `undefined` doesnt fall back. Both come from #68846 though\n\ncan send fix if you tell me how static `--x` should behave with namespacing",
